    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55348" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατασφρᾱγίζω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		 and 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-σφρηγίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>seal up</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jb.</u>
				9.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				37.7
			</span></i>: mostly pf.
			part.
			
				Pass.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεσφρηγισμένος</span>
			<i>sealed up, made fast, secured</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρκοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					115.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				947
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				762
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Erx.</u>
				400a
			</span></i>, etc.: impf.
			
				Pass.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεσφρηγίζετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tryph.
					68
				</span></i>
			: fut. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφραγισθήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Hermes</u>
					64.64
				</span></i>
			 (Epid., <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>): aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεσφραγίσθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					2.5
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τὰς θύρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					842a29
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				6.21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>: 
				Ep.
			aor. 1 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίσσατο</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				45.188
			</span></i>.</div>
